    "text": "<p>Match the following</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Column<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Column<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>.</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Nylon 6</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>.</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Natural Rubber</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>.</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Vulcanized Rubber</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>II</mi><mo>.</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Cross Linked</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>.</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">cis<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo></math>polyisoprene</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>III</mi><mo>.</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Caprolactam</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>.</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Polychloroprene</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>IV</mi><mo>.</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Neoprene</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from options given below:</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
